{
  "content": "<h1><span translate=\"true\" keyword=\"StartingBalances\">Starting Balances</span></h1><p translate=\"true\" keywords=\"Account Accounts And Balance Count On Settings StartingBalance StartingBalances To ToDate\">The <em>Starting Balances</em> feature, found under the <strong>Settings</strong> tab, allows you to set up starting balances for all your accounts and subsidiary ledgers.</p><div class=\"flex pointer-events-none space-x-6 rtl:space-x-reverse items-center\"><div class=\"border rounded p-0.5 inline-block ltr:pr-8 rtl:pl-8\"><div class=\"bg-neutral-200 ltr:pl-8 rtl:pr-8\"><div class=\"border-x border-neutral-300 bg-neutral-100 h-2\"></div><div class=\"border-y ltr:border-l rtl:border-r border-neutral-300 bg-white p-4 flex gap-2 items-center\"><i class=\"fas fa-cog text-neutral-400\"></i><span class=\"font-semibold text-sm text-[#428bca]\"><span translate=\"true\" keyword=\"Settings\">Settings</span></span></div><div class=\"border-x border-neutral-300 bg-neutral-100 h-2\"></div></div></div><span class=\"rtl:hidden\"><i class=\"fas fa-circle-chevron-right text-lg text-neutral-300\"></i></span><span class=\"ltr:hidden\"><i class=\"fas fa-circle-chevron-left text-lg text-neutral-300\"></i></span><div class=\"border rounded inline-block pointer-events-none\"><div class=\"basis-72 flex items-center gap-2 p-4\"><i class=\"text-xl text-neutral-400 fas fa-fw fa-wand-magic-sparkles\"></i><span class=\"text-sm text-[#428bca]\"><span translate=\"true\" keyword=\"StartingBalance\">Starting balance</span></span></div></div></div><p translate=\"true\" keywords=\"Balance Is Journal JournalEntries JournalEntry On StartingBalance StartingBalances To ToDate User Users\">Many users prefer to establish their starting balances using a journal entry. However, this can result in overly long journal entries.</p><p translate=\"true\" keywords=\"Account And Balance Count Credit Debit Edit InventoryItem InventoryItems Item MoreThan On Qty QtyOnHand QtyToDeliver QtyToReceive StartingBalance StartingBalances To ToDate\">Starting balances involve more than just debits and credits. If you are using the <strong>Inventory Items</strong> tab, you might want to set up starting balances for <em>Qty on Hand</em>, <em>Qty to Deliver</em>, and <em>Qty to Receive</em>. These are starting balances for management purposes, not accounting purposes.</p><ul><li translate=\"true\" keywords=\"Account Accounts Balance Count Guides Is SpecialAccount SpecialAccounts StartingBalance StartingBalances\"><a href=\"guides/special-account-starting-balance-list\"><span translate=\"true\" keyword=\"StartingBalances\">Starting Balances</span> &mdash; <span translate=\"true\" keyword=\"SpecialAccounts\">Special Accounts</span></a></li><li translate=\"true\" keywords=\"Balance Guides Invoice Invoices Is Sales SalesInvoice SalesInvoices StartingBalance StartingBalances\"><a href=\"guides/sales-invoice-starting-balance-list\"><span translate=\"true\" keyword=\"StartingBalances\">Starting Balances</span> &mdash; <span translate=\"true\" keyword=\"SalesInvoices\">Sales Invoices</span></a></li><li translate=\"true\" keywords=\"Balance Guides Invoice Invoices Is PurchaseInvoice PurchaseInvoices StartingBalance StartingBalances\"><a href=\"guides/purchase-invoice-starting-balance-list\"><span translate=\"true\" keyword=\"StartingBalances\">Starting Balances</span> &mdash; <span translate=\"true\" keyword=\"PurchaseInvoices\">Purchase Invoices</span></a></li><li translate=\"true\" keywords=\"Balance Guides Investment Investments Is StartingBalance StartingBalances\"><a href=\"guides/investment-starting-balance-list\"><span translate=\"true\" keyword=\"StartingBalances\">Starting Balances</span> &mdash; <span translate=\"true\" keyword=\"Investments\">Investments</span></a></li><li translate=\"true\" keywords=\"Balance Guides InventoryItem InventoryItems Is Item StartingBalance StartingBalances To ToDate\"><a href=\"guides/inventory-item-starting-balance-list\"><span translate=\"true\" keyword=\"StartingBalances\">Starting Balances</span> &mdash; <span translate=\"true\" keyword=\"InventoryItems\">Inventory Items</span></a></li><li translate=\"true\" keywords=\"Assets Balance Guides Intangible_asset IntangibleAsset IntangibleAssets Is StartingBalance StartingBalances\"><a href=\"guides/intangible-asset-starting-balance-list\"><span translate=\"true\" keyword=\"StartingBalances\">Starting Balances</span> &mdash; <span translate=\"true\" keyword=\"IntangibleAssets\">Intangible Assets</span></a></li><li translate=\"true\" keywords=\"Assets Balance Fixed_asset FixedAsset FixedAssets Guides Is StartingBalance StartingBalances\"><a href=\"guides/fixed-asset-starting-balance-list\"><span translate=\"true\" keyword=\"StartingBalances\">Starting Balances</span> &mdash; <span translate=\"true\" keyword=\"FixedAssets\">Fixed Assets</span></a></li><li translate=\"true\" keywords=\"Balance ExchangeRate ExchangeRates Guides Rate StartingBalance StartingBalances\"><a href=\"guides/starting-exchange-rates-form\"><span translate=\"true\" keyword=\"StartingBalances\">Starting Balances</span> &mdash; <span translate=\"true\" keyword=\"ExchangeRates\">Exchange Rates</span></a></li><li translate=\"true\" keywords=\"Balance Employee Employees Guides Is StartingBalance StartingBalances\"><a href=\"guides/employee-starting-balance-list\"><span translate=\"true\" keyword=\"StartingBalances\">Starting Balances</span> &mdash; <span translate=\"true\" keyword=\"Employees\">Employees</span></a></li><li translate=\"true\" keywords=\"Account Accounts Balance CapitalAccount CapitalAccounts Count Guides Is StartingBalance StartingBalances\"><a href=\"guides/capital-account-starting-balance-list\"><span translate=\"true\" keyword=\"StartingBalances\">Starting Balances</span> &mdash; <span translate=\"true\" keyword=\"CapitalAccounts\">Capital Accounts</span></a></li><li translate=\"true\" keywords=\"Account Accounts And Balance BankAndCashAccounts Count Guides Is StartingBalance StartingBalances\"><a href=\"guides/bank-or-cash-account-starting-balance-list\"><span translate=\"true\" keyword=\"StartingBalances\">Starting Balances</span> &mdash; <span translate=\"true\" keyword=\"BankAndCashAccounts\">Bank and Cash Accounts</span></a></li><li translate=\"true\" keywords=\"Account Accounts Balance BalanceSheet BalanceSheetAccount BalanceSheetAccounts Count Guides Is StartingBalance StartingBalances\"><a href=\"guides/balance-sheet-account-starting-balance-list\"><span translate=\"true\" keyword=\"StartingBalances\">Starting Balances</span> &mdash; <span translate=\"true\" keyword=\"BalanceSheetAccounts\">Balance Sheet Accounts</span></a></li></ul>",
